Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Bulala King
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 9
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So high
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we still get the Golden Bulala?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We have endured all the difficulties on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.23,0:00:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe we can get back the Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.79,0:00:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.23,0:00:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear anything just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.47,0:00:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.59,0:00:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that you are too tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.40,0:00:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who can help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,let’s go and see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he really needs help
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.12,0:01:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.64,0:01:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.44,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you found the person calling for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.81,0:01:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What a big bird’s nest
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.21,0:01:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You are
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fluffy Little Frost
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.76,0:01:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fluffy Little Frost
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.45,0:01:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fluffy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.53,0:01:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Frost
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.89,0:01:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one who knows my baby name is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Father
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s me It’s me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.49,0:01:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Fluffy Little Frost
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.41,0:01:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,king
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.45,0:01:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The king is okay
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, I will rescue you right now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.80,0:02:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I was used as nesting material by that bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that bird
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Frost, quickly get out of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.44,0:02:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the giant bird is back
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll contain it, save His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.71,0:02:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.99,0:02:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Frost, please be gentle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.91,0:02:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This nest is still being built and is not strong
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.07,0:03:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,sorry sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We accidentally made its nest look like this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.05,0:03:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do now that the giant bird is angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to repair its nest
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.16,0:03:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This will appease it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.69,0:03:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll help Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.33,0:03:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,let’s go
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.08,0:03:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we are repairing your nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.40,0:03:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t be angry
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.59,0:04:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems more angry
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.11,0:04:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bird, look
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please sign for the ultra-luxurious big bird’s nest
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.23,0:04:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Little Frost?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.39,0:04:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,fine
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.95,0:04:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.43,0:04:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go while it’s happy now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.71,0:04:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good, Master Quan
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.47,0:04:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sparky is missing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.63,0:04:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.31,0:05:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the future king of our Bulala Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.72,0:05:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate children the most
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate children the most
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.27,0:05:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle it is thundering
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.95,0:05:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.63,0:06:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,can I stay with you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks, Prince Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back and rest quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.35,0:06:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, I want to stay here tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.87,0:06:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,please
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you are not allowed to kick the quilt
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, let’s play together
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who let you in? Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.70,0:06:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I too cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.13,0:07:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help Uncle sew the embroidery
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.33,0:07:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,to apologize to Uncle
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s not how it’s embroidered
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.52,0:07:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me teach you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,where has he gone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.24,0:07:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When I collected Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.28,0:07:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people said they saw the prince heading towards the Thorn Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.89,0:07:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather the troops to go to the Thorn Forest
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.37,0:07:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, His Majesty has become like this
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.76,0:07:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but is still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s really awesome
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.73,0:07:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We Bulala people, as long as the Heart Knot remains,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.45,0:07:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,even if we are scattered, we can survive as long as we can stitch it back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So magical
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not good, Father’s Heart Knot is too frayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Need to be stitched quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.77,0:07:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But there’s still a long way to go back to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.28,0:07:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Use what’s nearby. There is some Bulala right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.28,0:08:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s go separate ways
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.28,0:08:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we’ve collected everything, let’s start repairing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.64,0:08:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bula-bula
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.56,0:08:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bula-bula
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.48,0:08:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can also do Hulala
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What Hulala?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re talking about Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a blessing to be recited while knitting the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.64,0:08:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bula-Bula Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.88,0:08:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, your knitting skills are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what Uncle taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But why hasn’t His Majesty woke up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it stands to reason that Father should be awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.15,0:08:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, Father, Father
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m teasing you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, it’s great that you’re okay
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, what happened that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.27,0:09:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,that day
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,what is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.71,0:09:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mon—monster appeared
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.00,0:09:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So scary
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be afraid, everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You are afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.36,0:10:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We are good people too
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.64,0:10:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t have to be afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.24,0:10:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, this monster doesn’t seem that dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We can tell everyone that you don’t have to be afraid anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s very docile
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.53,0:10:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, save me, brother
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.49,0:11:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s how it is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this happen? How could Uncle stand by and watch you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.83,0:11:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it happened suddenly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be so scared that he was stunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.02,0:11:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, Brother is fine too. I’m really lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.71,0:11:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go to the bottom of the cliff and get the Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone no longer has to be afraid of the monster
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.02,0:11:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s find it quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.34,0:11:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Bulala is here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You found Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems a little different
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.85,0:11:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why doesn’t it shine?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.21,0:11:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.17,0:11:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So where is the real Golden Bulala?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.81,0:11:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You have found it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.61,0:12:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,where
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.57,0:12:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You will know gradually
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s as if His Majesty didn’t say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.17,0:12:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s always been like this, just get used to it
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
